===Etymology===
{{root|de|ine-pro|plewd-}}
From {{inh|de|gmh|vluz}}, from {{inh|de|goh|fluz}}, ultimately from the root of {{m|de|fließen|t=to flow}}.

Not cognate with {{ncog|la|fluvius}}, which derives instead from {{ncog|ine-pro|*bʰlewH-}}.

